nCopilot reviewed 12 out of 15 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| test/integration/anthropic_client_test.go | New integration test validating a single GenAI client span is produced for Anthropic Messages. |\r\n| test/apps/anthropicclient/main.go | New minimal Anthropic client app used by integration CI. |\r\n| test/apps/anthropicclient/go.mod | Defines the integration test app module and Anthropic SDK dependency. |\r\n| test/apps/anthropicclient/go.sum | Dependency lockfile for the integration test app. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/otelc.yaml | Registers the `NewClient` hook injection for the Anthropic SDK. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/hook.go | Adds the `BeforeNewClient` hook to inject middleware when instrumented. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/hook_test.go | Unit tests for enable/disable gating behavior of the hook. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/middleware.go | Implements HTTP middleware to create GenAI spans and parse request/response attributes. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/middleware_test.go | Unit tests for operation classification, provider mapping, parsing, and span attribute shape. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/streaming.go | Stub streaming reader to keep spans open until SSE streams are consumed. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/semconv/genai.go | Defines GenAI semantic convention attribute keys/helpers for this instrumentation. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/go.mod | New module definition for the Anthropic instrumentation package. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go/go.sum | Dependency lockfile for the Anthropic instrumentation module. |\r\n| docs/getting-started.md | Documents Anthropic instrumentation in the supported libraries list. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/689#pullrequestreview-4700220260","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/689","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/689#pullrequestreview-4700220260"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/689"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-15T01:52:26Z","commit_id":"e4540391919d7cfa7baba467407be9e1f439fc44"},{"id":4700247038,"node_id":"PRR_kwDONpzSS88AAAABGCgT_g","user":{"login":"NameHaibinZhang","id":30917104,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTE3MTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30917104?u=80ffc21438259f8aa2c800410bc58e47cc28f875&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NameHaibinZhang","html_url":"https://github.com/NameHaibinZhang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NameHaibinZhang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NameHaibinZhang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NameHaibinZhang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NameHaibinZhang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://